## Security

Report a vulnerability through [the private advisory form]({{ repo.url }}/security/advisories/new)
rather than a public issue.

`cargo deny check` gates the advisory database on every pull request. zizmor audits the workflows
themselves under its pedantic persona, on every pull request and again weekly, because they are
the one body of code here with write access to the repository.

